isibility: visible;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px; text-align: right; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">《餐饮品牌如何规范安全防加盟》</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 25px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">上午的课程，马俊龙律师结合自身丰富法律经验，深入剖析餐饮品牌在加盟过程中常见的法律风险。马律师通过几个实际案例指出擅用顶层设计布局，严守合规底线，才能撬动百城千店。从连锁加盟模式的分析到加商业特许经营备案，再到品牌商标、知识产权规范，马律师全方位助力延边餐饮企业筑牢法律防线，保障品牌健康发展。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 20px 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.562962962962963\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72IRIkfIP4wdOgzVX15Mo9hh1sYJFt5pxwicvpeHOYUE3IWEMNXluO23vSDnBUN3gUQQp30jQ4S4uCg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=2\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.77632) / 1; width: 609px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"5\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='